            "review_title": "Review at Minamoto Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tori Goe\nChiba Prefecture, Japan47 contributions\n0\nA friendly and delicious Japanese izakaya. English and Japanese menus available\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nIn February 2025, I visited Izakaya Minamoto with my friends. The restaurant was crowded with local Japanese and Vietnamese people and had a fun atmosphere.\nThe friendly owner Murata creates a warm atmosphere. Communicate with both tourists and local customers without discrimination. This restaurant has a large menu, and you'll find something you like. English menu is also available. It is available in 5 languages.\nRecommendations are posted on the board in the store. You can have a good time with fresh sashimi and izakaya menu. It is a valuable place for Japanese people to enjoy the same taste as an izakaya you eat in Japan.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten February 9, 2025\nKouichi M\nThank you! Enjoy our restaurant.\nI'm glad to have a good time with you\nWritten February 10, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
